*.onnx
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.gguf
*.npz
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip
# Logs and runtime state
*.log
logs/
current_run
# Music: only the licence register is tracked
worker-node/music/*
!worker-node/music/LICENSES.csv
!worker-node/music/tools/
# pins.env is tracked (D2) but matches *.env above (01 CR-11 note, found at implementation 2026-09-25)
!worker-node/pins.env
# Trial runs: keep metadata (run.json, *.jsonl, *.csv, stages.json, ffprobe.json, notes.md), never media
trial/runs/no-run/
trial/runs/*/media/
# M0 story harness raw cells (02.1.3-T0, plan §3.6 / QA-02D-6): provider output, regenerable, untracked
trial/stories/
# 02.6.1-T2 live review reports: acceptance-<model>-<stamp>.json carries numbers and ids only (D19/T25), regenerable, untracked
trial/review/
# 02.5.2-T0 research corpus: the fetched third-party HTML is a regenerable cache (7.8 MiB, over the
# task file's 5 MiB snapshot budget), so only the manifest, sha256 and derived metrics are committed.
# Rebuild: see plans/features/02-story-writing/02.5.1-sources-fetcher/spike-report.md §4.
trial/research/corpus/html/
# Python / tooling
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

# --- 09.1.1-T1: .NET build output (.env is covered by .env* above) ---
bin/
obj/
*.user
TestResults/
docker-compose.override.yml
# --- 09.1.5-T1: the OpenAPI document is generated at build (09 README D14) ---
# `dotnet build src/NightTales.Api` writes it; the CI job uploads it as the `openapi` artifact.
src/NightTales.Api/openapi.json
# --- 09.2.2-T2: the migration bundle is a build artifact, never committed ---
# `dotnet ef migrations bundle -o artifacts/nts-migrate` (~70 MB); 11.5.1 builds it in the pipeline.
artifacts/
# --- 09.4.2-T1: the catalog URL builder needs a `Storage` class-library folder ---
# `storage/` (media scratch, above) is matched case-insensitively on macOS (`core.ignorecase`), so it
# also hid `src/**/Storage/` and `tests/**/Storage/`. Re-include those trees: no generated media ever
# lives under `src/` or `tests/`, while 09.7.2-T1's blob store needs the same folder next.
!src/**/Storage/
!tests/**/Storage/
